SUMMARY:2026 Petaluma River Craft Beer Festival
DESCRIPTION:Discounted early bird tickets are now on sale for the 12th annual Petaluma River Craft Beer Festival Saturday\, September 12 from 1-5 p.m. in historic downtown Petaluma where attendees can enjoy craft beer tastings from two dozen regional breweries\, delicious food from several of Petaluma’s top restaurants and live music from local bands. \nGeneral admission includes beer glass\, beer tastings and live music. Limited reduced price “designated driver” tickets are also available for $25 and include snacks\, nonalcoholic beverages and a $10 gift certificate for event food purchases. This is a 21-and-over event (no children or babies) and animals are not allowed. ID is required at the gate\, which will be located at Water Street near the Balshaw Bridge. \nHosted by the Petaluma Valley and Petaluma Sunrise Rotary clubs\, the annual community fundraising event benefits local non-profit initiatives serving Petaluma school children\, isolated seniors\, local homeless people as well as Petaluma River enhancement projects.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/2026-petaluma-river-craft-beer-festival/
LOCATION:Water Street @ Petaluma River\, Water Street\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Festival,Other
END:VEVENT
