SUMMARY:Movie Night: Grease
DESCRIPTION:Schedule:\n• Classic Car Show: 5-7 p.m. (free\, open to the public)\n• Meet and Greet with Kelly Ward of “Grease”: 6:30-7:30 p.m. (ticket holders only)\n• Movie Screening: 7:30-10 p.m. (ticket holders only) \nMovie Night on the Lawn is getting a retro twist! Join us for a family-friendly evening inspired by classic 1950s cruise-night fun\, featuring a screening of Grease under the stars.\nBefore the movie begins\, stroll through a pre-show classic car display\, enjoy juicy burgers\, and sip your favorite Dry Creek Vineyard wines. We’re thrilled to welcome actor Kelly Ward\, beloved for his role as T-Bird Putzie in the film\, for a special appearance.\nGuests of all ages are encouraged to dress up and lean into the era — whether you’re channeling Danny or Sandy\, rolling in with the T-Birds\, sparkling with the Pink Ladies\, or putting your own vintage spin on it. Prizes for standout costumes will be awarded!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/movie-night-grease/
LOCATION:Dry Creek Vineyard\, 3770 Lambert Bridge Road\, Healdsburg\, CA
CATEGORIES:Film,Other
END:VEVENT
